WEBVTT

00:11.080 --> 00:14.780
You all trained incredibly hard
these two weeks.

00:14.780 --> 00:17.160
Let's make sure it pays off today.

00:17.500 --> 00:18.530
Who's winning?

00:18.530 --> 00:19.540
We're winning!

00:20.080 --> 00:22.910
What about the three remaining spots?

00:22.910 --> 00:25.040
I've got help coming.

00:25.950 --> 00:27.290
Need help?

00:27.770 --> 00:29.390
'Kay, 'kay, we'll do it.

00:30.080 --> 00:32.350
Oh, hey, speak of the devil.

00:33.300 --> 00:38.890
Sorry. The three of us got sick
one after another, so we can't do it.

00:39.060 --> 00:43.060
Quiz time! Who was the start
and who was the end?

00:48.100 --> 00:53.320
This may be a practice match,
but take this seriously.

00:53.320 --> 00:54.600
Yeah, yeah, whatever.

00:54.600 --> 00:55.700
What a drag.

00:55.700 --> 00:58.130
Win, and I'll treat you to barbecue.

00:58.130 --> 01:00.840
Aw, shit! Victory or bust!

01:00.840 --> 01:02.080
Um...

01:03.390 --> 01:06.210
We have three absences due to illness...

01:06.580 --> 01:11.710
Could we please add some friends
and family to the team last minute?

01:12.320 --> 01:16.740
This won't really be practice
if we can't play and all...

01:28.270 --> 01:29.660
Go ahead.

01:29.660 --> 01:31.130
Thank you so much!

01:31.970 --> 01:34.990
And the match begins.

01:48.710 --> 01:53.920
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

01:54.750 --> 01:57.590
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

01:57.590 --> 01:59.880
(Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep)

01:59.880 --> 02:01.470
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

02:01.470 --> 02:02.720
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

02:02.720 --> 02:04.220
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

02:05.390 --> 02:07.930
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

02:07.930 --> 02:10.350
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

02:10.350 --> 02:12.650
(Kusuri
Has newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

02:12.650 --> 02:13.310
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

02:13.310 --> 02:13.980
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

02:13.980 --> 02:15.520
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

02:15.650 --> 02:20.360
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

02:23.110 --> 02:24.780
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

02:30.410 --> 02:32.460
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

03:06.040 --> 03:09.500
Jurassic High School
start the game on offense.

03:12.260 --> 03:16.050
Ohana-no-Mitsu University
High School on defense.

03:17.330 --> 03:22.090
Talk about an out-there
school name, really.

03:22.090 --> 03:23.050
On both sides.

03:25.750 --> 03:26.790
Play ball!

03:31.190 --> 03:32.100
Strike one!

03:32.100 --> 03:34.180
Yeah! Way to go, Iku!

03:34.180 --> 03:35.770
"A renowned dragon slayer!"

03:41.670 --> 03:42.910
Strike two!

03:45.800 --> 03:47.790
Strike three! Yer out!

03:47.790 --> 03:49.290
Ugh.

03:49.290 --> 03:52.980
They've got a real ace.
Our barbecue's in danger.

03:52.980 --> 03:53.540
Oh.

03:53.920 --> 03:55.370
That's Sutou Iku.

03:55.370 --> 03:56.230
Huh?

03:58.590 --> 04:00.440
Strike three. Yer out.

04:00.440 --> 04:02.590
Hey, that is her.

04:03.470 --> 04:06.600
But didn't that incident
in middle school...

04:07.400 --> 04:12.010
I see, very good. Don't have to worry
about her on offense, then.

04:12.680 --> 04:14.350
And, on top of that...

04:14.740 --> 04:16.300
Three outs! Change sides!

04:20.570 --> 04:21.490
Play!

04:27.730 --> 04:30.040
I'm gonna hit it come what may.

04:31.000 --> 04:33.050
Tyranno Cannon!

04:33.050 --> 04:35.960
Didn't know we were going all
yelling-out-special-moves style!

04:37.420 --> 04:38.420
Down the middle!

04:45.330 --> 04:46.160
Strike one!

04:49.250 --> 04:51.780
It just... broke my bat?

04:51.780 --> 04:52.750
That's right.

04:53.550 --> 04:59.280
Terano's a power pitcher who only
throws middle-middle fastballs.

04:59.280 --> 05:04.700
But she throws so much heat that it
saws off bats, and I catch every ball.

05:04.700 --> 05:07.800
That means unlimited
foul tips and strikeouts!

05:07.800 --> 05:09.580
Explaining-special-moves style, too!

05:13.240 --> 05:15.780
So we named our battery the...

05:16.360 --> 05:18.460
Double Dino Destiny Duo!

05:18.460 --> 05:20.210
Don't give yourselves a moniker!

05:20.210 --> 05:21.980
Our prey never escapes.

05:21.980 --> 05:24.470
Two lizards coming for you...

05:24.470 --> 05:26.190
The Double Dino Destiny Duo!

05:26.190 --> 05:27.380
It'll never catch on.

05:28.630 --> 05:29.500
Strike two!

05:30.900 --> 05:32.890
Strike three! Yer out!

05:32.890 --> 05:38.060
Gah! Why'd this stupid anime need
immersion-breaking, overpowered dino-girls?!

05:38.060 --> 05:41.320
I hope you get panned
by every baseball fan out there!

05:48.030 --> 05:51.080
There you are, Sutou Iku.

05:51.390 --> 05:53.450
You can do it, Ranoko!

05:53.450 --> 05:54.080
Oko!

05:54.080 --> 05:55.710
Focus!

06:06.820 --> 06:08.580
You can do it!

06:10.440 --> 06:11.340
Strike one!

06:15.220 --> 06:16.940
Strike two!

06:16.940 --> 06:18.000
Iku?

06:18.000 --> 06:19.980
They were both right down the pipe.

06:19.980 --> 06:21.730
No swing, no hit!

06:21.730 --> 06:25.230
Knew it. She's not over it yet.

06:25.690 --> 06:29.240
Yeah. I need to swing... I have to.

06:29.600 --> 06:30.680
I have to win!

06:33.000 --> 06:34.120
I'll hit this!

06:34.870 --> 06:35.740
Is she gonna...?

06:41.790 --> 06:44.920
Tyranno Cannon... Full Burst!

06:51.700 --> 06:54.220
Strike three! Yer out!

06:57.000 --> 06:58.040
Iku!

07:01.880 --> 07:05.330
She won't be pitching
too good for a while.

07:05.330 --> 07:10.010
This thing T-wrecks Terano's arm,
so it's only usable once a day...

07:10.010 --> 07:12.490
Tyranno Cannon Full Burst!

07:12.780 --> 07:13.800
Iku!

07:13.800 --> 07:15.130
Are you okay?

07:15.130 --> 07:16.640
Need cooling!

07:16.640 --> 07:18.500
Please use this Mr. Cooling Spray.

07:18.980 --> 07:21.650
With Iku unable to pitch,

07:21.650 --> 07:24.500
Nano took the mound.

07:24.500 --> 07:27.000
Iku took over in right field,

07:27.000 --> 07:29.980
and Shizuka moved to second base.

07:29.980 --> 07:35.720
But this defensive adjustment
led to the Jurassic offense exploding.

07:40.490 --> 07:45.480
What's more, they couldn't score off
of Terano's Tyranno Cannon.

07:45.480 --> 07:48.980
The gap just kept growing.

07:48.980 --> 07:50.360
Darn it!

07:50.910 --> 07:54.150
This is what real athletes can do.

07:54.660 --> 07:58.480
No fair! How can we newbs beat them?

07:58.480 --> 07:59.240
I'm sorry.

08:00.210 --> 08:02.490
If only I hadn't gotten myself injured...

08:02.490 --> 08:04.650
You did nothing wrong, Iku-sama.

08:04.650 --> 08:06.900
You all practiced so hard for this.

08:06.900 --> 08:08.730
It's too early to give up.

08:09.390 --> 08:10.380
But...

08:11.000 --> 08:15.140
If we're seven runs behind at the end
of the seventh, the game'll be called.

08:15.540 --> 08:17.390
We can't let them score here.

08:17.700 --> 08:19.440
Shore up the defense.

08:21.160 --> 08:26.520
No pep talk's gonna fix their morale.

08:26.900 --> 08:31.530
We gotta finish this game
before Sutou Iku recovers.

08:31.930 --> 08:33.840
Gotta make sure...

08:35.160 --> 08:36.910
to push the advantage.

08:37.240 --> 08:38.900
Target identified.

08:42.770 --> 08:44.040
Nice swing!

08:47.910 --> 08:49.040
Safe!

08:49.420 --> 08:52.090
No worries! Focus on the next batter!

08:53.550 --> 08:56.440
Y'know, I've been watching...

08:57.220 --> 08:59.300
And you've been messing up the most.

09:00.620 --> 09:03.310
You realize you're dragging them down?

09:06.060 --> 09:08.300
Too bad your team's forced
to play with you.

09:08.300 --> 09:10.970
I feel sorry for them.

09:27.000 --> 09:27.920
Shizuka-san!

09:38.510 --> 09:39.490
Back home!

09:39.490 --> 09:40.890
This way, Shizuka-chan!

09:47.560 --> 09:48.650
Run scored!

09:49.620 --> 09:50.650
Run scored!

09:51.710 --> 09:52.740
Run scored!

09:57.800 --> 09:58.740
Out!

09:58.740 --> 10:00.440
Three outs! Change sides!

10:02.740 --> 10:06.620
Three runs, and now? That seals the deal.

10:06.620 --> 10:10.750
They gotta have given up now!

10:11.270 --> 10:13.130
Are you okay, Shizuka-chan?

10:13.140 --> 10:17.950
S-Sorry... I-I'm so sorry...

10:17.950 --> 10:20.680
I ruined it for everyone...

10:20.680 --> 10:23.400
That's not true. Why would you think that?

10:24.260 --> 10:29.220
That lizard-girl was
trash-talking Shizuka just now!

10:29.220 --> 10:31.770
What? No way...

10:56.740 --> 10:59.420
You're in total despair.

10:59.780 --> 11:02.800
Relax. It'll be over soon.

11:03.070 --> 11:05.890
For you and that stupid baby.

11:05.890 --> 11:07.560
"Stupid baby"?

11:08.140 --> 11:09.860
Tyranno Cannon!

11:21.860 --> 11:25.120
You talking about our Shizuka?!

11:26.490 --> 11:28.200
Mur...

11:28.200 --> 11:29.800
der...

11:29.800 --> 11:31.290
Me...

11:31.290 --> 11:33.000
te...

11:33.000 --> 11:36.620
or!

11:43.340 --> 11:44.760
If you can't hit,

11:45.020 --> 11:46.260
bunt to get on!

11:46.260 --> 11:47.760
- That's it, Hakari!
bunt to get on!

11:47.760 --> 11:51.020
Frick yeah! Rentaro's plan was perfect!

11:51.020 --> 11:54.150
Aim high and smack it into the ground!

11:54.150 --> 11:57.900
Find a different angle if the pitch
has too much force head-on!

11:57.900 --> 11:59.030
What does this mean?

11:59.030 --> 12:02.330
Help! Terminator's charging at me!

12:02.330 --> 12:03.160
What does that mean?!

12:03.160 --> 12:03.980
Safe!

12:03.980 --> 12:05.240
She's eating the base!

12:05.240 --> 12:06.280
What does that mean?!

12:06.280 --> 12:09.540
Do your worst!
I'll catch it, no matter what!

12:09.540 --> 12:10.910
Your lead is my command.

12:13.660 --> 12:14.970
White Ball from Dorabase?!

12:14.970 --> 12:16.130
What does that mean?!

12:17.710 --> 12:19.760
Grargh! Ball be my friend!

12:19.760 --> 12:22.260
Screw the pain!

12:22.260 --> 12:23.630
Good as new!

12:23.630 --> 12:24.760
What is going on?!

12:25.010 --> 12:28.010
Wh-Where's all this coming from?

12:28.380 --> 12:32.200
You kicked the wrong box, Pandora.

12:32.200 --> 12:33.600
You... you...

12:33.600 --> 12:35.270
What are you guys?!

12:35.770 --> 12:41.280
They are the warriors
you've heard of in legends.

12:41.280 --> 12:42.790
Who's talking?!

12:42.790 --> 12:44.570
Pure of love and awakened by fury.

12:44.970 --> 12:46.870
We are the Super GFaiyans!

12:48.510 --> 12:49.870
Sparking!

12:49.870 --> 12:51.750
What does that mean?!

12:54.140 --> 12:55.940
Who're you calling Master Roshi?!

12:55.940 --> 12:58.520
Nobody said a damn thing!

12:58.520 --> 13:00.700
To be continued just a little bit more.

13:02.200 --> 13:04.010
Two outs, bottom of the 9th.

13:04.500 --> 13:07.030
Everyone did their best
and turned the game around.

13:07.030 --> 13:08.260
The comeback's almost complete!

13:09.070 --> 13:10.020
Go for it.

13:10.880 --> 13:12.710
Go for it, Kusuri-senpai!

13:13.650 --> 13:15.470
Tyranno Cannon!

13:18.120 --> 13:20.930
Crap! They know exactly what to do!

13:20.930 --> 13:23.650
This is what happens when you can
only throw middle-middle!

13:25.760 --> 13:26.660
Got it.

13:26.660 --> 13:31.540
Too bad for you.
I'm gonna tag you for the last out.

13:33.310 --> 13:34.290
Wha?!

13:35.930 --> 13:37.250
Safe!

13:37.250 --> 13:41.120
Yay! Rentaro's genius plan worked!

13:41.120 --> 13:42.750
We back on the Dorabase bullshit?!

13:42.750 --> 13:45.780
Hey, ump! She's doping!

13:45.780 --> 13:48.960
Not really performance-enhancing.

13:49.500 --> 13:50.490
Safe!

13:50.490 --> 13:52.260
Stupid anime logic!

13:52.260 --> 13:54.520
You can do it, Hahari-san!

13:54.520 --> 13:55.770
Mother!

13:56.110 --> 13:59.520
If you do it, Karane-san
will kiss you on the cheek!

13:59.520 --> 14:00.890
Like hell I will!

14:02.860 --> 14:04.510
Okay, she'll make it!

14:04.510 --> 14:06.410
Mother!

14:06.990 --> 14:08.200
Hahari-san?!

14:08.200 --> 14:09.990
Those massive mounds tripped her up!

14:12.360 --> 14:16.000
Oh no... Her hands aren't on the base.

14:16.000 --> 14:17.100
Ou...

14:18.000 --> 14:18.900
Glomp.

14:18.900 --> 14:19.730
Safe!

14:19.730 --> 14:21.250
Tit's a miracle!

14:21.250 --> 14:22.970
Hahari-sama!

14:22.970 --> 14:24.170
Stay, stay!

14:24.170 --> 14:26.060
Good hustling, Hahari-san!

14:26.060 --> 14:28.630
That's our current size leader for you.

14:40.670 --> 14:42.600
Okay, we're good.

14:42.600 --> 14:45.020
This weakling hasn't even
managed a bunt yet.

14:45.020 --> 14:47.150
This game is over!

14:47.600 --> 14:49.110
Shizuka-chan...

14:50.990 --> 14:52.120
It's okay.

14:52.920 --> 14:56.170
You're not being a burden or anything.

14:56.170 --> 14:57.870
I know you know this.

14:58.840 --> 15:05.380
We only got here because
we were all in it together.

15:08.920 --> 15:10.560
Tyranno Cannon!

15:11.010 --> 15:13.770
What can you do with your twigs for arms?

15:13.770 --> 15:14.390
Wha?!

15:14.760 --> 15:16.650
What's with that stance?!

15:17.440 --> 15:19.390
That's it, Shizuka-chan!

15:20.020 --> 15:23.420
By hugging her bat instead of holding,
she's keeping it more stable.

15:23.420 --> 15:27.620
And by hugging it upside down,
she's got a better grip on the thicker side.

15:27.620 --> 15:29.400
And the narrow end
gives the ball more airtime.

15:29.900 --> 15:32.410
While it does make
hitting the ball harder,

15:32.920 --> 15:35.160
that's not a problem if you know
the exact pitch location!

15:37.890 --> 15:39.160
But she's slow as molasses!

15:39.630 --> 15:40.790
I can throw her out!

15:41.290 --> 15:43.040
Make it, make it...

15:44.170 --> 15:46.290
Make it, make it!

15:46.290 --> 15:49.050
I have to make it, no matter what!

15:52.880 --> 15:56.600
Looking at her running as fast as she can
with her tiny body and little limbs!

15:57.500 --> 16:00.890
She's just like my Chii-chan
who died last year!

16:01.310 --> 16:04.410
I can't see through the tears!

16:04.410 --> 16:06.190
What're you doing, you dumbass?!

16:06.440 --> 16:07.480
Shizuka-san!

16:07.480 --> 16:09.300
Go!

16:14.650 --> 16:16.450
Safe!

16:16.450 --> 16:18.410
Shizuka-chan!

16:18.410 --> 16:19.950
You did it, Shizuka!

16:21.450 --> 16:24.490
Well done, Chii-chan.

16:24.490 --> 16:26.210
First baseman, yer outta here! Ejected!

16:26.520 --> 16:30.020
Are you kidding me?
Bases loaded in the 9th?

16:30.020 --> 16:33.220
What if they somehow hit a grand slam...

16:34.250 --> 16:37.470
Wait, no. The next batter is her!

16:39.500 --> 16:41.450
Good luck, Sutou Iku.

16:41.450 --> 16:43.480
You can do this, Iku-senpai.

16:43.760 --> 16:44.520
Yeah.

16:45.980 --> 16:46.980
I'll finish this.

16:50.580 --> 16:51.640
Iku.

16:51.640 --> 16:52.760
What?

16:52.760 --> 16:54.280
What's the matter?

16:54.280 --> 16:58.020
The Iku I know always plays
baseball with a smile.

16:58.020 --> 16:58.740
But...

16:59.390 --> 17:01.900
Not today, not when
you're in the batter's box.

17:03.060 --> 17:07.750
Even in your first at-bat when your arms
were fine, you let two good pitches go.

17:08.170 --> 17:09.520
Is there a problem?

17:10.420 --> 17:12.130
You see everything, Rentaro.

17:12.620 --> 17:14.090
Some time ago...

17:18.780 --> 17:24.480
A homerun ball I hit
hurt a girl in the stands.

17:27.160 --> 17:33.360
Since then, I flash back to the sight
every at-bat and can barely hit.

17:33.360 --> 17:34.150
No...

17:34.850 --> 17:36.110
But it's okay.

17:36.650 --> 17:37.800
I'll hit this one.

17:38.160 --> 17:40.840
To keep my word of keeping
the baseball team alive.

17:40.840 --> 17:45.910
And for my beloved Rentaro Family,
for offering to help me.

17:46.280 --> 17:47.500
If I don't hit today,

17:48.290 --> 17:50.630
my time playing baseball
will have been meaningless!

17:50.920 --> 17:53.800
Yeah! We know you can do it!

17:53.800 --> 17:56.380
Send that BS pitch flying!

17:57.900 --> 17:58.780
Iku...

18:06.640 --> 18:09.150
Hmph, not like you're gonna swing.

18:09.730 --> 18:11.450
Tyranno Cannon!

18:19.770 --> 18:20.950
Foul!

18:24.380 --> 18:25.290
Foul!

18:33.350 --> 18:36.040
You've gotta hit it. You've gotta.

18:37.050 --> 18:38.140
Hit it!

18:39.070 --> 18:39.960
Hit it!

18:40.630 --> 18:43.050
I'll hit it for the baseball team,

18:43.650 --> 18:45.060
and for the Rentaro Family!

18:46.500 --> 18:48.560
She can barely foul 'em off.

18:48.560 --> 18:51.060
Now she's on her third strike.

18:51.410 --> 18:52.560
This ends now!

18:52.560 --> 18:54.010
Finish it!

18:54.010 --> 18:54.820
Okay.

18:56.490 --> 18:58.190
Tyranno Cannon...

18:58.460 --> 19:00.490
Full Burst!

19:01.490 --> 19:02.450
That pitch again?!

19:05.360 --> 19:07.260
Tyranno Cannon Full Burst,

19:07.260 --> 19:12.210
a max-power pitch that
wrecks her arm if used twice in a day.

19:12.210 --> 19:17.340
But if it's the last pitch of the game,
that changes nothing!

19:17.760 --> 19:21.340
Catching that thing twice a day
will wreck my hand too, but...

19:21.690 --> 19:25.220
Let's feast on that BBQ
in the afterlife, my dino sister!

19:34.030 --> 19:35.730
What a powerful pitch!

19:39.660 --> 19:42.820
The windburst cut through
her clothes like Shaolin Soccer!

19:43.450 --> 19:46.830
I gotta hit this... but my arms!

19:49.960 --> 19:52.780
Send it, Iku!

19:53.740 --> 19:57.130
I'll catch it, no matter what!

19:57.130 --> 20:00.760
So send it my way!

20:22.530 --> 20:23.500
Bring it!

20:28.120 --> 20:29.120
Rentaro!

20:29.400 --> 20:30.670
I'll catch it...

20:30.670 --> 20:31.930
I'll catch it!

20:31.930 --> 20:34.250
I'll catch it, no matter what!

20:34.250 --> 20:35.880
If I don't,

20:36.300 --> 20:38.500
Iku'll never be able to hit again!

21:03.060 --> 21:05.770
Home run! Ballgame!

21:05.770 --> 21:09.980
Ohana-no-Mitsu-or-Whatever
High School wins by a score of 9-10!

21:14.510 --> 21:15.980
We did it. We won...

21:15.980 --> 21:17.420
- Rentaro!
We did it. We won...

21:19.170 --> 21:19.940
Thank you—

21:21.470 --> 21:24.980
N-N-No, Iku! Your underwear!

21:26.580 --> 21:29.860
I don't know if it counts
as appreciation coming from me, but...

21:38.550 --> 21:40.270
Thank you, Rentaro.

21:42.060 --> 21:43.110
I love you!

23:19.500 --> 23:21.210
Look at her eat.

23:21.210 --> 23:23.000
She's beating you, Saurko.

23:23.000 --> 23:24.180
Another plate?

23:24.300 --> 23:29.260
Everyone played hard, so they were
rewarded with barbecue for all.

23:29.610 --> 23:31.260
You don't have to rush.

23:31.260 --> 23:32.930
Thank you for today.

23:32.930 --> 23:34.760
Wazzat?

23:35.130 --> 23:37.170
Eat up, Chii-chan!

23:37.170 --> 23:38.770
You can have mine, too.

23:39.020 --> 23:41.210
Sorry about what I said during the game.

